{"symbol":"RAF.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:56:05Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Staszica 1","city":"Kuznia Raciborska","zip":"47-420","country":"Poland","phone":"48 32 721 3113","website":"https://www.rafamet.com","industry":"Tools & Accessories","industryKey":"tools-accessories","industryDisp":"Tools & Accessories","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Fabryka Obrabiarek RAFAMET S.A., together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells special purpose machine and mechanical tools in Poland and internationally. It operates through three segments: Machine Tools, Castings and Models, and Other Products and Services. The company offers machines for railways, including above and under floor wheel, axle, and wheel and axle lathes, as well as wheel boring machines, software, shunting vehicles, and measuring and diagnostic systems; heavy-duty machine tools, such as vertical turning and horizontal lathes; and grey iron castings, ductile, and alloy cast iron. It also provides large part machining services comprising turning, milling, drilling, horizontal boring, and grinding; general overhauls, modernizations, and relocations of machine tools; and mechanical and hydraulic design, engineering, and CNC machine tool software services. In addition, the company offers technical support services, which include assembly, installation, and commissioning of machine tools, as well as adjustments, technical inspections, maintenance, and guarantee and after-guarantee repairs; mechanical, electrical, electronic components, and software service works; and trainings. It sells its products under the RAFAMET and POREBA brand names. The company's products are used in machine-building, power generation, metallurgical, shipbuilding, and defense industries. It exports its products. The company was founded in 1846 and is headquartered in Kuznia Raciborska, Poland. Fabryka Obrabiarek RAFAMET S.A. operates as a subsidiary o